.TH DAQ-LS2JSON 1 "2026-09-10" "mu2edaq-shifter-tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
daq-ls2json \- dump directory listings to JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B daq-ls2json
[\fB\-o\fR \fIfile\fR]
[\fB\-D\fR]
[\fB\-\-indent\fR \fIn\fR]
[\fB\-v\fR]
[\fIdirectory\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B daq-ls2json
records the contents of one or more directories \(em name, type, size
and modification time \(em as JSON, so that two machines, or the same
machine at two points in time, can be compared with an ordinary
\fBdiff\fR.
.PP
The output is a list of objects, one per directory:
.PP
.RS
.nf
[
  {
    "directory": "/home/mu2edaq/config",
    "files": [
      {"name": "tracker.fcl", "type": "file",
       "size": 4096, "modified_time": 1789062768.8}
    ]
  }
]
.fi
.RE
.PP
A directory that cannot be read contributes an \fBerror\fR key
alongside an empty \fBfiles\fR list, so a partial failure is visible in
the output instead of being silently dropped. Entries that vanish
during the walk, and broken symlinks, are skipped.
.PP
With no directory argument the current directory is used.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Write the JSON to \fIFILE\fR instead of standard output. Progress
messages go to stderr, so the file receives only JSON.
.TP
.BR \-D ", " \-\-include\-dirs
Include subdirectories in the listing, each typed as
\fBdirectory\fR. By default only files are listed.
.TP
.B \-\-indent " " \fIN\fR
JSON indentation. Default 4; use 0 for one compact line, which diffs
poorly but greps well.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Print a per-directory entry count, and any errors, to stderr.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the package version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a usage summary and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 when the listing was produced, including when some directory
reported an error, and 1 when the output file could not be written.
.SH EXAMPLES
Compare a release directory across two nodes:
.PP
.RS
.nf
ssh mu2edaq01 daq-ls2json /mu2e/releases/v9_00_00 > a.json
ssh mu2edaq02 daq-ls2json /mu2e/releases/v9_00_00 > b.json
diff a.json b.json
.fi
.RE
.PP
Record several directories, including subdirectories:
.PP
.RS
.nf
daq-ls2json -D -o listing.json /home/mu2edaq/config /home/mu2edaq/data
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR daq-cluster-cp (1),
.BR daq-install-tools (1),
.BR diff (1),
.BR jq (1)
